        "question_ygCe6x": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do HempLucid products contain THC? Will I fail a drug test?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Full-Spectrum CBD Products:</strong>HempLucid's full-spectrum CBD products contain trace amounts of THC (less than 0.3%), and many users find that our<a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/edible-cbd\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">best full spectrum cbd gummies</span></a>provide a convenient way to experience the complete entourage effect. Please note: it is possible to test positive on a drug test when consuming even trace amounts of THC.<br/><br/><strong>THC-Free CBD Products:</strong>Our THC-free CBD (broad-spectrum and isolate) products are tested at several intervals of the manufacturing process to ensure undetectable levels of THC. In rare cases, it may be possible to trigger a false positive on a drug test when using THC-free products due to other cannabinoid metabolites.<br/><br/>And while we ensure our broad-spectrum products test at less than 0.001% THC, it’s worth noting that any quality hemp-derived extracts have the potential to trigger a false positive on a drug test, in rare cases. This is true of any THC-free or broad-spectrum hemp products on the market.<br/><br/><a href=\"/blogs/blog/how-does-cbd-work\" title=\"Does CBD get your high?\">For more info, read this blog post about CBD and drug tests.</a></p>",
            "button_txt": "",
