          }
        },
        "question_Y9pYXy": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which extraction method does HempLucid use?",
            "answer": "<p>For our full-spectrum products, we use a supercritical CO2 extraction method to produce a clean, solvent-free hemp extract. Our products undergo the process of winterization and decarboxylation where ethanol is used (none will be found in our final product) to remove the fats and waxes your body cannot break down.</p>",
