          "settings": {
            "title": "Are HempLucid products organic?",
            "answer": "<p>Our premium hemp genetic is grown on Certified Organic US farmland. We are one of the 5% of CBD companies that are USDA Organic Certified. We have secured USDA Organic Certification for several of our products and will continue to pursue Organic Certification wherever possible. Our<a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/cbd-tinctures\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">organic cbd tinctures</span></a>are among the products that have earned this certification.<br/><br/>We do have some products that are not USDA Organic Certified but are made with organic ingredients.</p>",
