          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is Delta 8?",
            "answer": "<p>Delta 8 tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) is very closely related to Delta 9 THC, but the minor difference in chemical composition also removes some of the psychoactive properties. Delta 8 is mildly sedative but doesn’t produce the same kind of high as delta 9.<br/><br/>For more detailed info, check out our <a href=\"/collections/delta-8\">blog post</a> on Delta 8.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_wnMMBM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can Delta 8 Tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) cause a positive drug test?",
            "answer": "<p>Potentially, yes.<br/><br/>It is possible that Delta 8 THC can cause a positive drug test result. Unfortunately, most drug tests don’t differentiate between Delta 8 (hemp-derived) THC and Delta 9 (marijuana-derived) THC.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_zw8UEE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Should I take Delta 8 THC if I’m expected to take regular drug tests?",
            "answer": "<p>The safest option is to not take Delta 8 THC when you know you are going to be drug tested. Of course, we encourage you to closely monitor the legal status of Delta 8 in your state to make sure you comply with current laws and regulations.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_68NnWh": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can taking THC and CBD together increase my risk of a positive drug test?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes.<br/><br/>While broad-spectrum and isolate CBD products are considered THC-free, full-spectrum CBD oil contains less than 0.3% THC. Many people find that combining CBD with THC on a regular basis encourages the entourage effect, where cannabinoids synergistically work together. However, taking THC and CBD together may increase your risk of a positive drug test.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_TLqP4e": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What can I do if I am worried about taking Delta 8 THC and getting a positive drug test?",
            "answer": "<p>We have a few main suggestions when it comes to navigating THC use and drug tests:<br/><br/>1. Understand the risks of consuming CBD and THC. While there are many potential benefits, it is important to be aware of local regulations, rules, and laws as they relate to THC.<br/><br/>2. Advocate for better drug tests at work, at schools, and within other institutions and organizations. Current drug testing doesn’t do a great job of detecting specific cannabinoids or differentiating between dangerous levels and not-so-dangerous levels. Better testing would allow more people to experience the potential benefits without having so much stigma or risk attached.<br/><br/>3. Help to educate your coworkers, friends, and family members. When appropriate, and in states where Delta 8 is legal, you may want to disclose your Delta 8 use to supervisors or friends in an effort to be transparent and proactive. For example, explaining to a manager that you take low levels of Delta 8 to stay productive may help to destigmatize use at work and allow you to work more efficiently without the fear or risk of being “caught.”</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_rXCerD": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the benefits of Delta 8?",
            "answer": "<p>Check out our <a href=\"/collections/delta-8\" title=\"What is Delta 8 THC?\">blog post</a> on Delta 8.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        }
      },
